      "so_that": "HR can tell whether I am Swiss without me giving my nationality when it changes nothing",
      "priority": "P1",
      "priority_reason": "Without nationality HR cannot tell Swiss employees from other employees living in Switzerland. Today Swiss employees get the source tax questions, get annoyed and call HR (F-TR-005).",
